## About the Government Offices

The Government Offices (Regeringskansliet) prepare government matters and assist ministers in their work. In the regulatory domain it issues government bills, ordinances and other governing documents that authorities then apply.

## Role in regulatory work

The government issues ordinances and empowers authorities to issue regulations. The Government Offices also coordinate the transposition of EU acts into Swedish law.
